&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📰 Classifieds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📮 &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/192119/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;CraftForms&lt;/a&gt;: Hosted forms for any site, no backend needed. Two-line embed, unlimited submissions even on the &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/192119/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;free plan&lt;/a&gt;, no captcha.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🧾 &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/192120/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Add PDF editing to your app with Foxit's API&lt;/a&gt;: Merge, split, rotate, replace pages and flatten annotations, with working code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=" font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
